Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.94,0:08:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《雷神3：诸神黄昏》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:22.29,注释,,0000,0000,0000,,(荫萌疗养院)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.51,0:15:19.94,注释,,0000,0000,0000,,(布里克街177A)
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.36,2:02:45.37,注释,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:20.70,2:10:24.50,注释,,0000,0000,0000,,雷神将在《复仇者联盟3: 无限战争》中回归
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:00:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你在想什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I know what you're thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:01:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 托尔被关在笼子里了 怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Oh, no! Thor's in a cage. How did this happen?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:02.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时 你得先被抓住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, sometimes you have to get captured{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.88,0:01:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才能从某人那里问出个所以然来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just to get a straight answer out of somebody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.06,0:01:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说来话长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.16,0:01:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但其实 我算是个英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But basically, I'm a bit of a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去地球待了一阵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I spent some time on Earth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.40,0:01:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打过几个机器人 救了地球几次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fought some robots, saved the planet a couple of times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我去宇宙中寻找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I went searching through the cosmos{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几颗有魔法的多彩的无限宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for some magic, colorful Infinity Stone things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但没找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't find any.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这时我遇到了一条死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's when I came across a path of death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和毁灭之路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and destruction...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.99,0:01:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而因此来到了这个笼子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which led me all the way here into this cage...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.57,0:01:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还遇见了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where I met you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我们还要在这里待多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much longer do you think we'll be here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尔 奥丁之子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor, son of Odin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.91,0:02:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏尔特尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surtur,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.34,0:02:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王八\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}son of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.78,0:02:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之子 你还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a bitch. You're still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我父亲杀掉你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought my father killed you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.25,0:02:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在50万年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a half a million years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.75,0:02:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没有实现命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not until I fulfill my destiny...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毁灭你的家乡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and lay waste to your home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.04,0:02:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正好你提起这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's funny you should mention that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.89,0:02:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我最近一直在做噩梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I've been having these terrible dreams of late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德陷入烈火 成为一片灰烬 而你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asgard up in flames, falling to ruins. And you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.45,0:02:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏尔特尔 处于那一切之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surtur, are at the center of all of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.72,0:02:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你已经见识到了诸神黄昏 阿斯加德的陨落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you have seen Ragnarok, the fall of Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.91,0:02:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 伟大的预言 - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The great prophecy... - Hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.11,0:02:32.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.40,0:02:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就能转回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}back around shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.45,0:02:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真觉得我们刚刚聊得很投机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really feel like we were connecting there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.06,0:02:44.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 诸神黄昏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so Ragnarok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.64,0:02:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我讲讲 仔细说说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about that. Walk me through it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的时代到来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My time has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等我的王冠再次沐浴永恒烈火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When my crown is reunited with the Eternal Flame...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就将恢复全部力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall be restored to my full might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.70,0:02:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比山还高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will tower over the mountains...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:03:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把剑深深插入阿斯加德的 - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and bury my sword deep in Asgard's... - Oh, hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.59,0:03:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓 我根本没动 是它自己在转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear I'm not even moving. It's just doing this on its own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.74,0:03:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm really sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.71,0:03:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 是这么回事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so let me get this straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.02,0:03:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要把你的王冠放进永恒烈火里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to put your crown into the Eternal Flame...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.03,0:03:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你会突然变得有房子那么大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then you'll suddenly grow as big as a house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.36,0:03:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mountain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永恒烈火 是奥丁锁在阿斯加德的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Eternal Flame that Odin keeps locked away on Asgard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥丁不在阿斯加德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Odin is not on Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.86,0:03:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你的离开让王权失去了防卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your absence has left the throne defenseless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.49,0:03:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 那王冠在哪呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so where is it? This crown?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.81,0:03:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我的王冠 我力量的源泉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my crown, the source of my power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是王冠啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's a crown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.94,0:03:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你是眉毛长得比较夸张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was a big eyebrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:37.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是王冠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a crown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之 听上去 我想阻止诸神黄昏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, it sounds like all I have to do to stop Ragnarok...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只需要扯下你脑袋上那玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is rip that thing off your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.77,0:03:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但诸神黄昏已经开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Ragnarok has already begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你无法阻止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.94,0:04:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是阿斯加德的末日 你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Asgard's doom, and so are you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都将遭受煎熬 被烈火吞噬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All will suffer, all will burn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.08,0:04:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's intense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说 看着你变得老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be honest, seeing you grow really big...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后烧掉一颗星球 肯定很壮观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and set fire to a planet would be quite the spectacle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.91,0:04:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但看来我只能选择第二条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it looks like I'm gonna have to choose option B...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.54,0:04:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是我挣脱这铁链\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where I bust out of these chains...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把你的头饰从脑袋上砸下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}knock that tiara off your head,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后藏在阿斯加德的地堡里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and stash it away in Asgard's vault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.30,0:04:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你无法阻止诸神黄昏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot stop Ragnarok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.43,0:04:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,何必抵抗呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why fight it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为 英雄都会这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because that's what heroes do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.31,0:04:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 抱歉 我时机掐得不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, I'm sorry. I didn't time that right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你犯了个大错误 奥丁森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have made a grave mistake, Odinson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我经常犯大错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I make grave mistakes all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来结果还不错嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything seems to work out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.77,0:06:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海姆达尔 我知道我们好久没联系了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heimdall, I know it's been a while,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我真的很需要赶紧离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I could really use a fast exit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海姆达尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heimdall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海姆达尔就是个蠢货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heimdall was an idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:25.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这份工作本该让他发财的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This job should have made him rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.56,0:06:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这份工作并不轻松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, the job ain't easy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.09,0:06:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但还是有些好处的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it does have its benefits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.32,0:06:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彩虹桥让我可以接触到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Bifrost gives me access to everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:34.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,九大王国的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Nine Realms has to offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想拿就拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean it's all mine for the taking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behold...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我特别喜欢这俩玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm particularly fond of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从米德加德 一个叫德克萨斯的地方拿到了它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pulled them out of a place on Midgard called Texas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.90,0:06:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还给它们起了名字 毁天和灭地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I even named them. Des and Troy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:06:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为 当它们合在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, when you put them together...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.31,0:06:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就能毁天灭地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they destroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海姆达尔 拜托了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heimdall, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.41,0:07:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海姆达尔 我要没招了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heimdall? I'm running short on options.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海姆达尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heimdall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.93,0:07:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯科尔奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skurge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个要紧吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that important?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩姑娘今天有好戏看了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You girls are in for a treat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,姑娘们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girls!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呦呦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.75,0:09:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看是谁决定回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look who decided to pop in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你吓跑了我的女伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for scaring away my company{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还弄得我的办公场所全是脑浆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and drenching my workplace in brains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不记得了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.26,0:09:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯科尔奇 我们曾在华纳海姆并肩作战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Skurge. We fought together on Vanaheim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.07,0:09:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海姆达尔呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Heimdall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.19,0:09:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个叛徒 没人知道 他是王室逃犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That traitor. No one knows. He's a fugitive of the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.49,0:09:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叛徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traitor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 奥丁指控海姆达尔玩忽职守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Well, you see, Odin charged Heimdall with negligence of duty...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他在审判前就消失不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he disappeared before the trial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 想抓住一个能洞察宇宙中一切的人不容易 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hard to catch a guy who can see everything in the universe. - Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 我要宣告你的到来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on. Hold on. I'm supposed to announce your arrival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么玩意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.10,0:10:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥 时候到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, brother. This is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.38,0:10:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要离世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take my leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.09,0:10:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真傻 怎么不听我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fool, you didn't listen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.73,0:10:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希芙女士 去找人帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lady Sif, get help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.02,0:10:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁来帮帮忙啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody, help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.56,0:10:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为我做的一切道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry for all I've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.26,0:10:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的 撑住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh. It's all right. Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.39,0:10:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.23,0:10:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我企图统治地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on. I tried to rule Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有你只会是他们的幸运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'd be lucky to have you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宇宙魔方的事我也很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry about that thing with the Tesseract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.62,0:10:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我就是忍不住 - 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I just couldn't help myself. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我喜欢耍诡计 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm a trickster. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总爱搞恶作剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So mischievous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.78,0:10:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我那次把你变成了只青蛙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about that time I turned you into a frog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.67,0:10:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是很有趣的笑话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a wonderful joke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.34,0:10:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的确是非常好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Twas indeed hilarious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是阿斯加德的拯救者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the savior of Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.82,0:10:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 讲述我的故事 - 我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell my story. - I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.93,0:10:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为我建一座雕像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Build a statue for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会为你建一座大雕像的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will build a big statue for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还要戴着我的头盔 有大弯角的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With my helmet on, with the big bendy horns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的英勇 我会禀告父王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will tell Father what you did here today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.65,0:10:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是为了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't do it for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.11,0:10:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是为了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't do it for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛基因伤不治而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so, Loki died of his wounds...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他为我们献出了生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}giving his life for ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.62,0:11:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他击退了那些可憎的精灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fought back those disgusting elves...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为王国带来了和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he brought peace to the realm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.47,0:11:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loki,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛基 我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my boy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.09,0:11:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多年前 我发现了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'twas many moons ago I found you on that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.60,0:11:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那覆满冰霜的战场上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}frostbitten battlefield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.81,0:11:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那天 我尚未看出你是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On that day, I did not yet see in you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.64,0:11:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德的拯救者 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asgard's savior. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.13,0:11:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were merely{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小蓝冰棍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a little blue baby icicle...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:44.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却融化了我这老傻瓜的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that melted this old fool's heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.74,0:11:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,精彩 精彩 演得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo! Bravo! Well done. Bravo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.25,0:11:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.47,0:11:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:12:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的儿子 托尔回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my son, Thor, has returned!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:01.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 我的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greetings, my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这出戏真有趣 叫什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an interesting play. What's it called?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德的洛基之惨剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Tragedy of Loki of Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人民想纪念他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people wanted to commemorate him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:10.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是该如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, indeed they should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢那座雕像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like the statue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比他在世时要好看多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot better looking than he was when he was alive, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.90,0:12:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不那么猥琐 油腻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little less weaselly, less greasy, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.03,0:12:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这是什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what this is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.65,0:12:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏尔特尔的头骨 厉害的武器啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The skull of Surtur. That's a formidable weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.65,0:12:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮个忙 把这个锁进地堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do me a favor. Lock this away in a vault...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.21,0:12:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,免得它变成巨大的怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so it doesn't turn into a giant monster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.13,0:12:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毁了整个星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and destroy the whole planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.95,0:12:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, dear. Um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回米德加德了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}back to Midgard for you, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.44,0:12:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最近老做同一个梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been having this reoccurring dream lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每晚上 我都看到阿斯加德化为灰烬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every night, I see Asgard fall into ruins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过是个没意义的梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just a silly dream...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.78,0:12:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说明你的想象力太丰富了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}signs of an overactive imagination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.10,0:12:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Possibly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.02,0:12:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我决定出去勘察一番\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then I decide to go out there and investigate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what do I find,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,九大王国一片混乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the Nine Realms completely in chaos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德的敌人集结起来 阴谋致我们于死地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enemies of Asgard assembling, plotting our demise...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.42,0:12:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all while you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.52,0:12:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥丁 九大王国的保护者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Odin, the protector of those Nine Realms...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却穿着浴袍坐在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are sitting here in your bathrobe,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吃着葡萄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}eating grapes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我们最好尊重邻居的自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it is best to respect our neighbors' freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.80,0:13:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 被屠杀的自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, of course, the freedom to be massacred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是啊 而且 我一直忙着呢 - 看剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, besides I've been rather busy myself. - Watching theater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.57,0:13:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,委员会会议 安全理事会会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Board meetings, and security council meetings...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.11,0:13:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你真要逼我这么做吗 - 做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're really gonna make me do it? - Do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很清楚 什么都无法阻止雷神之锤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that nothing will stop Mjolnir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.18,0:13:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回到我手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as it returns to my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪怕是你的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你发疯了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've gone quite mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.14,0:13:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你会被因此处死的 - 那我们就可以在另一边相见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You'll be executed for this. - Then I'll see you on the other side,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I yield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.66,0:13:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.53,0:13:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 奥丁森 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Odinson. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就一份工作 就这一份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had one job. Just the one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.90,0:13:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥丁在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Odin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:13:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就不能别回来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just couldn't stay away, could you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有你一切都好好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything was fine without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.18,0:14:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德繁荣昌盛 都叫你毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asgard was prospering. You've ruined everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.41,0:14:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 问问他们 - 父亲在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ask them. - Where's Father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.63,0:14:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你杀了他吗 - 你得到你想要的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you kill him? - You had what you wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.97,0:14:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得到你要的独立了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had the independence you asked for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇 哇 哇 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, whoa! Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.34,0:14:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很清楚他在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know exactly where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓我就是把他留在这儿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear I left him right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.77,0:14:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是在人行道上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right here on the sidewalk,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是在那栋正被拆除的建筑里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or right there where the building is being demolished?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,计划得真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great planning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.47,0:14:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was I supposed to know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又不能看到未来 我不是巫师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't see into the future. I'm not a witch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.36,0:14:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 那你为什么穿得像个巫师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No? Then why do you dress like one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:38.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨 - 真不敢相信你还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - I can't believe you're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到你死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.52,0:14:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为你哀悼 为你哭泣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mourned you, I cried for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.29,0:14:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm honored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去问他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.90,0:14:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以跟我们合个影吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. Would you mind taking a picture with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.97,0:14:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快想想他在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start figuring out where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.55,0:14:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很遗憾 简甩了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry to hear that Jane dumped you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她才没甩我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She didn't dump me, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.97,0:14:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我甩了她 我们彼此互甩的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dumped her. It was a mutual dumping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.55,0:15:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事 你在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this? What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.20,0:15:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.65,0:15:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.56,0:15:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尔·奥丁森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor Odinson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.14,0:15:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God of Thunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以把伞放下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can put down the umbrella.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.13,0:16:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地球上现在还有男巫了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Earth has, uh, wizards now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.32,0:16:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们更喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The preferred term is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.49,0:16:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被称为"魔法师" 别管了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Master of the Mystic Arts. " You can leave that now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.55,0:16:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 男巫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, wizard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁 我为什么要在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you? Why should I care?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是斯蒂芬·斯特兰奇博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Doctor Stephen Strange,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.62,0:16:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有些问题要问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I have some questions for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.11,0:16:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喝茶吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喝茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't drink tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.04,0:16:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你喝什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.41,0:16:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不喝茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.88,0:16:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有一份关注名单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I keep a watch list{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是来自其他世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of individuals and beings from other realms...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.80,0:16:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能对这个世界构成威胁的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that may be a threat to this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.49,0:16:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的领养弟弟 洛基 就是其中之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your adopted brother, Loki, is one of those beings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.43,0:16:56.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的确该加上他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a worthy inclusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么带他来这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why bring him here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.64,0:17:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在找我父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're looking for my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么 如果我告诉你奥丁在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, if I were to tell you where Odin was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.94,0:17:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有相关人士 都会马上回阿斯加德吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all parties concerned would promptly return to Asgard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.45,0:17:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Promptly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.37,0:17:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 我来帮你吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great! Then I'll help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.49,0:17:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你知道他在哪 为什么不联系我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you knew where he was, why didn't you call me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.12,0:17:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得告诉你 他坚持不许人打搅他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to tell you, he was adamant that he not be disturbed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.69,0:17:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲说他选择继续被流放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father said he had chosen to remain in exile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你没有电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you don't have a phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't have a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电话 但你可以发个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}phone. but you could have sent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电子信件 叫电邮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an electronic letter. It's called an email.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.86,0:17:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗯 你有电脑吗 - 没有 干吗用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, do you have a computer? - No. What for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.25,0:17:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之 我父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, my father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.78,0:17:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不再被流放了 麻烦你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is no longer in exile. So if you could{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.67,0:17:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我他在哪 我就能带他回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tell me where he is, I can take him home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 他在挪威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gladly. He's in Norway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.69,0:17:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是查看一下 这则咒语是否\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just seeing whether this incantation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要为阿斯加德人做些调整\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}requires any Asgardian modifications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.88,0:17:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不需要那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, we don't need that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.57,0:17:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能别那么做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you stop doing that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.45,0:17:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以 我只要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I... I need{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一根头发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just one strand of your hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me explain something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的头发是碰不得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My hair is not to be meddled with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:14.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们完全可以用走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could have just walked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.72,0:18:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在等你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.11,0:18:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了你的伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget your umbrella.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.60,0:18:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.15,0:18:35.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.70,0:18:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还得要回我弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose I'll need my brother back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.42,0:18:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.31,0:18:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都下落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been falling{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.13,0:18:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,30分钟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for 30 minutes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.51,0:18:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就交给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can handle him from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.13,0:18:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.44,0:18:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much for your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.08,0:18:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"交给你"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Handle me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:18:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么术士吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you're some kind of sorcerer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.29,0:19:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你个二流货 别以为你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't think for one minute, you second-rate...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.97,0:19:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allrgihts. Bye-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.55,0:19:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这里 多美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this place. It's beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.31,0:19:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,父亲 是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, it's us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.13,0:19:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的儿子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在等你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.50,0:19:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 我们来接你回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. We've come to take you home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.57,0:19:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回家 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.70,0:19:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们母亲 她在召唤我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother, she calls me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.47,0:20:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们听到了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you hear it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.40,0:20:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛基 解除你的魔法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loki, lift your magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.62,0:20:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我花了好久才摆脱你的咒语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took me quite a while to break free from your spell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弗丽嘉会为你自豪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frigga would have been proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来陪我坐下 我没多少时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come and sit with me. I don't have much time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.17,0:20:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我们辜负了你 但我们可以弥补的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that we failed you. But we can make this right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.14,0:20:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我辜负了你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I failed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.14,0:20:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,诸神黄昏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ragnarok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我阻止了诸神黄昏 我了结了苏尔特尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I've stopped Ragnarok. I put an end to Surtur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.59,0:20:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.21,0:20:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经开始了 她要来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has already begun. She's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的生命是唯一遏制着她的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My life was all that held her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:42.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我大限将至\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my time has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.78,0:20:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法再抵住她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot keep her away any longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.70,0:20:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,父亲 你在说谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, who are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.21,0:20:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡女神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddess of Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.05,0:20:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的长女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My firstborn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.83,0:20:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.95,0:21:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的暴力欲望膨胀到我无法控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her violent appetites grew beyond my control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.05,0:21:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法阻止她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't stop her,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.14,0:21:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就囚禁了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I imprisoned her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.39,0:21:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把她关了起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Locked her away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.53,0:21:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她从阿斯加德汲取力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She draws her strength from Asgard...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.91,0:21:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等她到了那里 她的力量就将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and once she gets there, her powers will be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.72,0:21:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无可限量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}limitless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.99,0:21:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管她是什么 我们可以一同阻止她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever she is, we can stop her together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.44,0:21:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们可以一同对抗她 - 不行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We can face her together. - No, we won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.69,0:21:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已走上了另一条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on a different path now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.86,0:21:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这件事你们得独自面对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This you must face alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.88,0:21:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你们 我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, my sons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.17,0:21:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.69,0:21:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记住这地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.85,0:21:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,家园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.01,0:22:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.14,0:22:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这都怪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was your doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.06,0:23:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他死了啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.28,0:23:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真可惜 我还挺想看到那一幕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a shame. I would've liked to have seen that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.20,0:23:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是海拉吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be Hela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.26,0:23:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是托尔 奥丁之子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Thor, son of Odin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.03,0:23:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.72,0:23:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你长得不像他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't look like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.68,0:23:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们可以商量一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps we can come to an arrangement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.37,0:23:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你口气像他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sound like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.53,0:23:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跪下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kneel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.71,0:23:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beg your pardon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.42,0:23:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跪下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kneel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.28,0:23:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜见你的女王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before your queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.14,0:23:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别指望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.11,0:24:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.28,0:24:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 你根本想象不到我都能做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darling, you have no idea what's possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.98,0:24:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带我们回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring us back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.42,0:24:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.40,0:24:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loki!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.67,0:25:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁 你把托尔怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you? What have you done with Thor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.62,0:25:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是海拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Hela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.75,0:25:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是个扫地的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just a janitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.04,0:25:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看上去像个求生本能强烈的机灵鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like a smart boy with good survival instincts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.12,0:25:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要份工作吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How would you like a job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.44,0:28:10.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个战士吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you a fighter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.52,0:28:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or are you food?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.50,0:28:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是路过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just passing through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.88,0:28:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.32,0:28:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跪下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.11,0:29:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.94,0:29:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.92,0:29:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.41,0:29:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.43,0:29:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们想要他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you want him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.86,0:29:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得过我这关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you go through me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.95,0:29:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们已经得到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we've already got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.16,0:29:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.54,0:29:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就先过你们这关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I go through you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.40,0:29:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又来食物了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.83,0:30:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.91,0:30:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拾荒者142号 我需要进门并觐见老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scrapper 142. I need clearance and an audience with the boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.98,0:30:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我带来了特别的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got something special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.81,0:30:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你要带我去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Where are you taking me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.77,0:31:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回答我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Answer me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.36,0:31:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.46,0:31:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是托尔 奥丁之子 我得回阿斯加德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Thor, son of Odin. I need to get back to Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.35,0:31:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常抱歉 王子殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many apologies, your majesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.15,0:31:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发现 你们并不认识我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's come to my attention that you don't know who I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.76,0:31:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是海拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Hela,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.42,0:31:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥丁的长女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Odin's firstborn...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.54,0:31:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德大军的统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the commander of the Legions of Asgard...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.87,0:31:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,王位的合法继承人 死亡女神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the rightful heir to the throne, and the Goddess of Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.04,0:32:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲已死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.72,0:32:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两位王子也是 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As are the princes. You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.28,0:32:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们曾在宇宙中坐拥无上力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were once the seatof absolute power in the cosmos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.72,0:32:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的地位无可匹及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our supremacy was unchallenged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.05,0:32:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但奥丁却止步于九大王国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet Odin stopped at Nine Realms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.52,0:32:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的命运是统治所有其他王国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our destiny is to rule over all others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.64,0:32:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是来恢复那份权势的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am here to restore that power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.03,0:32:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我跪下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kneel before me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.86,0:32:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加入我 与我一起踏上伟大的征途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and rise into the ranks of my great conquest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.57,0:32:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever you are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.43,0:32:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你做了什么 马上投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whatever you've done, surrender now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.64,0:32:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则我们绝不留情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or we will show you no mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.91,0:32:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.54,0:32:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚说话你听没听啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you listen to a word I said?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.40,0:32:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你最后的警告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your last warning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.52,0:32:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你们会乐意见到我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you'd be happy to see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.23,0:32:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.94,0:33:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.83,0:34:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真怀念这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I've missed this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.04,0:34:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过 真是可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still, it's a shame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.17,0:34:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好战士白白枉死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good soldiers dying for nothing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.55,0:34:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就因为他们看不到未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all because they couldn't see the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.97,0:34:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,悲哀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.00,0:34:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看 他还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, look, still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.24,0:34:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,改主意了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Change of heart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.26,0:34:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚回你爬出来的山洞去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to whatever cave you crept out of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.64,0:34:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你个女魔头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You evil demoness!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.44,0:34:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去看看我的王宫吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go see my palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.26,0:35:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 你已被找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear not, for you are found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.65,0:35:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到家了 再也回不去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are home, and there is no going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.41,0:35:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人能离开此地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one leaves this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.60,0:35:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这里是什么地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what is this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.91,0:35:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.96,0:35:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sakaar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.12,0:35:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被宇宙传送门环绕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surrounded by cosmic gateways...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.39,0:35:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨卡位于已知和未知世界的边缘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sakaar fives on the edge of the known and unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.30,0:35:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里收集了所有迷失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the collection point{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.84,0:35:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不被爱的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for all lost and unloved things...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.44,0:35:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.01,0:35:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但在萨卡 你是重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But here on Sakaar, you are significant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.89,0:35:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是有价值的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are valuable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.44,0:35:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是被爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you are loved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.15,0:35:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.10,0:35:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人比宗师更爱你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no one loves you more than the Grandmaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.44,0:35:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是最初的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is the original,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.48,0:35:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第一个迷失 第一个被找到的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the first lost and the first found...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.28,0:36:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨卡的创始人 冠军格斗之父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the creator of Sakaar... and father of the Contest of Champions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.67,0:36:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然你曾经一文不名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where once you were nothing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.76,0:36:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在你有了身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now you are something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.12,0:36:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是宗师的财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the property of the Grandmaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.16,0:36:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.18,0:36:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你将在5秒后见到宗师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will meet the Grandmaster in 5 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.00,0:36:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.96,0:36:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.98,0:36:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你将见到宗师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are now meeting the Grandmaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.18,0:36:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他真棒 是个"他"吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's wonderful. It is a he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.64,0:36:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a he.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.20,0:36:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.84,0:36:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就喜欢你过来 142\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love when you come to visit, 142.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.97,0:36:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你总给我带最好的东西来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bring me the best stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.06,0:36:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每次我们聊起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whenever we get to talking,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.37,0:36:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托佩兹 拾荒者142号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Topaz, about Scrapper 142...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.78,0:36:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what do I always say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.16,0:36:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"她是" B开头的词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"She is the... " And it starts with a "B. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.56,0:36:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,垃圾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.38,0:36:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是垃圾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not trash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.04,0:36:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是就等着那么说她吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you waiting just to call her that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.65,0:37:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都不是B开头的词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't start with a "B. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.41,0:37:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酒鬼婆娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Booze hag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.73,0:37:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 不是"最好的"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I.. I... I'm so sorry. No, "best."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.61,0:37:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是想说"最好的"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was thinking about "best. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.89,0:37:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我总说你是最好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I always say you're the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.19,0:37:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她为我带来了我的格斗冠军呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She brought me my beloved champion, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.14,0:37:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每次她来你都这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say that every time she's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.06,0:37:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天带来的是什么 告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you brought today? Tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.93,0:37:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,参赛者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A contender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.94,0:37:16.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.11,0:37:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得凑近点 我要凑近看看他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to go closer. I want a closer look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.26,0:37:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以把我往前推推吗 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you take us closer? Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.18,0:37:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给她钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pay this lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.00,0:37:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我等一下 我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wait a damn minute. I'm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.34,0:37:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可不是卖品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not for sale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.18,0:37:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐 他挺有斗志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, he's a fighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.28,0:37:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要一千万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take 10 million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.76,0:37:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她那是做梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell her she's dreaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.87,0:37:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天 给她钱吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, for heaven's sakes, transfer the units.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.15,0:38:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会付出代价的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll pay for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.80,0:38:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 是别人付我钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I got paid for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.29,0:38:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's what I wanna know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.34,0:38:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.24,0:38:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是雷神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the God of Thunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.58,0:38:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没听到雷声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't hear any thunder,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.87,0:38:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你手上的是电火花吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but out of your fingers, was that sparkles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.79,0:38:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到你表亲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've located your cousin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.21,0:38:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, oh, good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.80,0:38:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 你会喜欢这个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, come on. I think you're gonna like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.13,0:38:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在这儿呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.22,0:38:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 表弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, cuz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.01,0:38:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们差点没找到你 你藏起来了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We almost couldn't find you. What, you been hiding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.35,0:38:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.18,0:38:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.73,0:38:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.14,0:38:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.00,0:38:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.45,0:38:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡洛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlo...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.09,0:38:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我赦免你 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I pardon you. - Oh, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.04,0:38:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.99,0:38:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你被赦免了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're officially pardoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.33,0:38:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,免了生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.58,0:38:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hey. Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.10,0:39:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.54,0:39:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,流到我脚下了 看啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm stepping in it. I'm stepping in it. Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.88,0:39:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好臭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, the smell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.04,0:39:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么味儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does it smell like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.22,0:39:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,烤焦的吐司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burnt toast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.59,0:39:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么这么没礼貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to my manners?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.75,0:39:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没好好自我介绍呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't properly introduced myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.34,0:39:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Uh, follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.65,0:39:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫宗师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Grandmaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.77,0:39:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我主持一项 滑稽表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I preside over a little harlequinade{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.50,0:39:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫做冠军格斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}called the Contest of Champions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.20,0:39:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来自各处的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People come from far and wide{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.73,0:39:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都会不情愿地参与其中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to unwillingly participate in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.37,0:39:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你 我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.40,0:39:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以加入新角色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might just be part of the new cast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.34,0:39:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say to that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.20,0:39:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是朋友 我也不在乎你的游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not friends and I don't give a shit about your games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.49,0:39:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要回阿斯加德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going back to Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.11,0:39:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿屎加德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ass-gard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.91,0:39:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三 四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, three, four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.58,0:39:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我下方有个时间空间的虫洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a Wormhole in space and time beneath me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.91,0:39:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At that moment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.74,0:39:44.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我放手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.25,0:39:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loki?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.71,0:39:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛基 洛基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loki! Loki!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.55,0:39:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here. Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.05,0:39:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 失陪一下 - 洛基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me one second. - Loki!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.26,0:39:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 干什么 - 你还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - You're alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.52,0:39:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我当然还活着 - 你怎么来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, of course I'm alive. - What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.57,0:40:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这话什么意思 我被困在这张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, what am I doing? I'm stuck in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.04,0:40:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,破椅子上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this stupid chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.79,0:40:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你怎么没坐椅子 - 没人让我坐椅子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's your chair? - I didn't get a chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.43,0:40:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 帮我从这椅子上起来 - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get me out of this one. - I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.69,0:40:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 帮我起来 - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get me out. What? - I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.40,0:40:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟那个宗师交了朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've made friends with this man. He's called the Grandmaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.17,0:40:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他是个疯子 - 我赢得了他的好感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, he's crazy! - I've gained his favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.88,0:40:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彩虹桥几周前把我丢到了这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Bifrost brought me out here weeks ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.60,0:40:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 几周前 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Weeks ago? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.78,0:40:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才刚到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.94,0:40:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在小声说什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you whispering about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.20,0:40:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的时间规律很不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time works real different around these parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.12,0:40:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在别的世界上 我都该几百万岁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On any other world, I'd be, like, millions of years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.33,0:40:22.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但在萨卡上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But here on Sakaar...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.38,0:40:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样 你认识这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In any case, you know this, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.62,0:40:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你称自己为雷王是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call yourself Lord of Thunder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.84,0:40:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷神 告诉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God of Thunder. Tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.14,0:40:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这辈子从未见过这个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never met this man in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.91,0:40:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他是我弟弟 - 领养的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's my brother. - Adopted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.71,0:40:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他能不能打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he any kind of a fighter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.42,0:40:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把我脖子上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take this thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.11,0:40:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,东西拿走 我就打给你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}out of my neck and I'll show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.28,0:40:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧 他在威胁我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, listen to that. He's threatening me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.23,0:40:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小火花 事情是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Sparkles, here's the deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.14,0:40:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想回到那个二死堡还是什么的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you wanna get back to Ass-place, Assberg...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.78,0:40:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.84,0:40:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,任何参赛者 只要能打败我的冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any contender who defeats my champion...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.87,0:40:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就能赢得自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}their freedom they shall win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.14,0:40:56.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 那就给我指个路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. Then point me in the direction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.68,0:40:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要我去揍的人在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of whoever's ass I have to kick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.37,0:41:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才是我的参赛者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I call, contender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.04,0:41:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这边走 大王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Direction would be this way, Lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.74,0:41:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 洛基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah! Loki!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.50,0:41:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 嘿 嘿 放松点 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, hey. Take it easy, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.68,0:41:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这边呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.68,0:41:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向你招手的一堆石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pile of rocks waving at you. Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.68,0:41:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我其实是有生命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm actually a thing. I'm a being.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.96,0:41:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请允许我做个自我介绍 我叫寇格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allow me to introduce myself. My name is Korg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.16,0:41:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我算是这里的领导吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm kind of like the leader in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.69,0:41:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也能看出来 我是石头做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm made of rocks, as you can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.47,0:41:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不要被我的外表吓到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't let that intimidate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.33,0:41:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不用害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't need to be afraid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.40,0:41:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非你是剪刀做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless you're made of scissors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.39,0:41:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是跟你开个 石头剪刀布的小玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a little rock-paper-scissor joke for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.99,0:41:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的好朋友 米克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my very good friend over here, Miek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.70,0:41:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是只有剪刀手的昆虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's an insect and has knives for hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.28,0:41:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是克努南人 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a Kronan, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.66,0:41:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没错 - 你怎么会落到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That I am. - How'd you end up in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.53,0:41:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我试图发动革命来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, well, I tried to start a revolution,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.35,0:41:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但没做好宣传工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but didn't print enough pamphlets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.25,0:41:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以几乎没人参加\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So hardly anyone turned up,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.35,0:41:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了我妈妈 和她那讨厌的男朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except for my mum and her boyfriend, who I hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.84,0:41:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,作为惩罚 我被迫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As punishment, I was forced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.88,0:41:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来到这里做个角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be in here and become a gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.65,0:41:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简直是个宣传灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bit of a promotional disaster, that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.55,0:41:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我其实在策划另一场革命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm actually organizing another revolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.45,0:42:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你是不是感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if you'd be interested in something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.64,0:42:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you reckon you'd be interested?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.61,0:42:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.84,0:42:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 这个地方其实是个圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, yeah, no. This whole thing is a circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.78,0:42:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不是真正的圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not a real circle,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.22,0:42:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更像是个恐怖怪圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}more like a freaky circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.03,0:42:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这没道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This doesn't make any sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.28,0:42:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 这里就是不讲道理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, nothing makes sense here, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.88,0:42:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没道理就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing that does make sense{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.37,0:42:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里的道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that nothing makes sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.11,0:42:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有人跟宗师的冠军打过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has anyone here fought the Grandmaster's champion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.60,0:42:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,道格打过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doug has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.70,0:42:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,道格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doug!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.91,0:42:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是命 道格已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our luck, Doug's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.39,0:42:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.80,0:42:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟宗师的冠军打过的人都死掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone who fights the Grandmaster's champion perishes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.88,0:42:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢 你是石头做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you? You're made of rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.77,0:42:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会死掉的石头 看啊 又掉一块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perishable rock. There you go. Another one gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.72,0:42:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是小打小闹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, no, I just do the smaller fights,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.48,0:42:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,暖暖场之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}warm up the crowd and whatnot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.71,0:42:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 你不是要去跟他打吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. You're not gonna face him, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.43,0:42:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.46,0:42:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟他打 打赢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna fight him, win,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.89,0:42:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后离开这鬼地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get the hell out of this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.05,0:42:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,道格以前就这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly what Doug used to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.02,0:42:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回见 新道格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you later, new Doug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.65,0:43:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人记得我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does no one remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.07,0:43:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人学过我们的历史吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has no one been taught our history?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.12,0:43:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这些谎言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at these lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.38,0:43:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高脚杯 花园聚会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goblets and garden parties?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.16,0:43:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和平协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peace treaties?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.47,0:43:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥丁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Odin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.88,0:43:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为成果骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}proud to have it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.78,0:43:22.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却觉得手段可耻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ashamed of how he got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.32,0:43:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们曾势不可挡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were unstoppable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.72,0:43:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在扩张阿斯加德帝国时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was his weapon in the conquest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.04,0:43:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾是他的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that built Asgard's empire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.13,0:43:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们征服了一个又一个王国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One by one, the realms became ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.64,0:43:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后 就因为我的野心比他更大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then, simply because my ambition outgrew his...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.02,0:44:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就将我放逐 囚禁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he banished me, caged me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.48,0:44:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像只野兽一样把我锁了起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}locked me away like an animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.95,0:44:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那之前 阿斯加德的战士是受尊敬的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before that, Asgard's warriors were honored...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.97,0:44:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的遗体 像英雄那样葬在这宫殿下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}their bodies buried as heroes beneath this very palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.71,0:44:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 奥丁的宝藏 - 赝品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Odin's treasures. - Fake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.58,0:44:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里大部分的东西都是赝品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of the stuff in here is fake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.80,0:44:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.11,0:44:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比我以为的要小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smaller than I thought it would be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.27,0:44:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个还可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.26,0:44:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.00,0:44:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永恒烈火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Eternal Flame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.29,0:45:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想看看真正的力量是什么样子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want to see what true power really looks like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.54,0:45:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的芬里斯 他们对你做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fenris, my darling, what have they done to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.72,0:45:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永恒烈火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the Eternal Flame,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.40,0:45:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将让你们重生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are reborn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.17,0:46:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've missed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.00,0:46:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想念你们大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've missed you all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.62,0:46:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥丁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Odin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.92,0:46:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我愿你升入英灵殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bid you take your place in the halls of Valhalla...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.44,0:46:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,勇者将在那里永生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where the brave shall live forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.39,0:46:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该高兴而不是哀伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nor shall we mourn but rejoice...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.94,0:46:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们死的光荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for those that have died the glorious death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.80,0:46:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,扎心 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurts, doesn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.48,0:46:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被欺骗的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Being lied to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.40,0:46:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你是一回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Being told you're one thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.17,0:46:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你发现那都是假的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then learning it's all a fiction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.56,0:46:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会以为我真的会来这里见你吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't think I'd really come and see you, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.56,0:46:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方太恶心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place is disgusting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.30,0:46:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不想要我帮忙吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this mean you don't want my help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.10,0:46:57.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能失去我在宗师身边的地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I couldn't jeopardize my position with the Grandmaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.34,0:46:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为赢得他的信任很费心力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It took me time to win his trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.94,0:47:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是个疯子 但也是有办法应付的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a lunatic, but he can be amenable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.44,0:47:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是想告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I'm telling you is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.83,0:47:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以跟我一起服侍宗师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you could join me at the Grandmaster's side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.91,0:47:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许 将来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps, in time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.08,0:47:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宗师会出事 然后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an accident befalls the Grandmaster, and then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.80,0:47:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是真在考虑回去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not seriously thinking of going back, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.60,0:47:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our sister{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.92,0:47:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像砸玻璃一样轻松毁了你的锤子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}destroyed your hammer like a piece of glass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.46,0:47:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她比我们都强 她比你强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's stronger than both of us. She's stronger than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.42,0:47:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一丝机会都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't stand a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.04,0:47:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你明白我什么意思吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand what I'm saying to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.78,0:47:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.46,0:47:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我得单干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I'll just have to go it alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.08,0:47:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一如既往\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like I've always done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.93,0:47:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能说点什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you say something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.83,0:47:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说话啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.58,0:47:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you like me to say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.19,0:47:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你装死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You faked your own death...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.56,0:48:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,偷了王位 剥夺了奥丁的法力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you stole the throne, stripped Odin of his power...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.03,0:48:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他留在地球上等死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stranded him on Earth to die,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.85,0:48:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放出了死亡女神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}releasing the Goddess of Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.56,0:48:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些够不够 还是你要我继续翻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have I said enough or would you like me to go back further than{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.81,0:48:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两天之前的旧账\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the past two days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.86,0:48:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没见过他口中这个宠儿冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I haven't seen this beloved champion he talks of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.74,0:48:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但听说他野蛮得吓人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I've heard he is astonishingly savage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.29,0:48:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天的格斗 我下了很大的注压你输\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've placed a large wager against you tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.46,0:48:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别让我失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.23,0:48:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,滚开 鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piss off, ghost!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.26,0:48:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's freaking gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.30,0:48:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恶心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.37,0:48:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这上面还留着不知谁的毛发和血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's still someone's hair and blood all over this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.86,0:48:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们 格斗完能不能清理下武器啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, can you clean up the weapons once you finish your fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.90,0:48:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恶心的懒蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disgusting slobs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.63,0:48:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 托尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Thor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.46,0:48:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用大木叉子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wanna use a big wooden fork?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.28,0:48:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.00,0:48:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 不太实用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, not really useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.34,0:48:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非你要打挤成一团的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you're fighting off three vampires{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.29,0:48:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三个吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that were huddled together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.60,0:48:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望我的锤子还在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really wish I had my hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.95,0:49:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,锤子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hammer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.63,0:49:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很特别 是用濒死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite unique. It was made from this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.46,0:49:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,星球内核的特别金属制成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}special metal from the heart of a dying star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.23,0:49:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我快速抡它 就能飞起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when I spun it really, really fast, it gave me the ability to fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.07,0:49:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你骑在锤子上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You rode a hammer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.34,0:49:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是骑在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I didn't ride the hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.07,0:49:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它骑在你背上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hammer rode you on your back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.34,0:49:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我快速抡它 它就会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I used to spin it really fast, and it would{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.13,0:49:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把我带起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pull me off the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.08,0:49:18.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 锤子给你撸吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. A hammer pulled you off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.30,0:49:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把我带离地面 它会带我离开地面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ground. It would pull me off the ground,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.28,0:49:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带我升入空中 我就能飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}up into the air, and I would fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.24,0:49:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把它扔出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time I threw it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.13,0:49:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它总能回到我手中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it would always come back to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.40,0:49:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和这把锤子的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like you had a pretty special{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.64,0:49:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像很特殊 很亲密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and intimate relationship with this hammer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.21,0:49:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失去它堪比失去爱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that losing it was almost comparable to losing a loved one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.15,0:49:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说挺温馨的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a nice way of putting it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.05,0:49:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了这些是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said they're mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.78,0:49:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看 就是她把我抓来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See her, that's the one that put me in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.00,0:49:43.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 拾荒者142号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. Scrapper 142.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.18,0:49:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要小心这些阿斯加德人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotta watch out for those Asgardians, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.38,0:49:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,命硬得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are hard to perish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.35,0:49:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asgardian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.45,0:49:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.81,0:49:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.30,0:49:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.56,0:49:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别用那玩意电我 我有话要说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not zap me with that thing. I just wanna talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.90,0:50:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德有危险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asgard is in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.68,0:50:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 你是女武神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, you're a Valkyrie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.17,0:50:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候还想当女武神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to wanna be a Valkyrie when I was younger...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.54,0:50:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但之后我发现你们都是女的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until I found out that you were all women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.90,0:50:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是女的没什么不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing wrong with women, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.05,0:50:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.52,0:50:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时太爱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes a little too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.15,0:50:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是猥琐的那种 是那种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not in a creepy way, just more of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.07,0:50:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尊重的欣赏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a respectful appreciation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.34,0:50:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能有一支女武士组成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's great that there is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.83,0:50:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,精英部队真的很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an elite force of women warriors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.01,0:50:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.23,0:50:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说完没 - 雷王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you done? - Lord of Thunder,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.71,0:50:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 该你了 - 求你 帮帮我 我需要你的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- you're up. - Please, help me. I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.64,0:50:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.56,0:50:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 那你不是叛徒就是懦夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine, then you must be a traitor or a coward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.61,0:50:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为女武神都发过誓要保卫王权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the Valkyrie is sworn to protect the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.97,0:50:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听仔细了 殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen closely, your majesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.63,0:50:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是萨卡 不是阿斯加德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Sakaar, not Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.46,0:50:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是拾荒者 不是女武神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm a Scrapper, not a Valkyrie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.54,0:50:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,带他过来收拾一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring him in for processing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.65,0:50:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人能逃出这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no one escapes this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.02,0:50:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你反正也是个死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're gonna die anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.22,0:51:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, don't you move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.93,0:51:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的手不如以前稳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My hands ain't as steady as they used to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.91,0:51:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以奥丁的胡子起誓 你不准剪我的头发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By Odin's beard, you shall not cut my hair...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.92,0:51:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然就会尝到托尔之怒的滋味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lest you feel the wrath of the mighty Thor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.91,0:51:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了 求你了 好心人 别剪我头发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Please, kind sir, do not cut my hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.79,0:51:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.05,0:51:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.54,0:51:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at all of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.24,0:51:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚比赛多么精彩 谁觉得开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a show! What a night! Who's having fun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.04,0:51:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你们的主持人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, I'm your host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.06,0:51:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请掌声感谢所有赛前战的格斗者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big round of applause for all of our undercard competitors...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.77,0:51:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们今天死得真可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who today died so gruesomely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.60,0:51:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比赛真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good sports.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.88,0:51:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚比赛多么精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a show! What a night!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.57,0:51:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是为格斗而来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what you've come for, and so have I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.74,0:52:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 不再耽搁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, without further ado...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.02,0:52:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,压轴比赛开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's main event time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.08,0:52:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽是首次登场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Making his first appearance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.79,0:52:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但却很有潜力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}though he looks quite promising...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.63,0:52:17.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点绝招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}got a couple of tricks up his sleeve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.89,0:52:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不再多说了 你们来自己判断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll say no more, see what you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.84,0:52:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们先生们 有请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen, I give you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.35,0:52:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord of Thunder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.74,0:52:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心他的手指 会放火花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out for his fingers. They make sparks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.05,0:52:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, this is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.90,0:52:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们准备欢迎这家伙吧 他来咯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get ready to welcome this guy. Here he comes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.76,0:53:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他这个家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is a creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.53,0:53:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要怎么说呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can we say about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.89,0:53:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很特别 独一无二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he's unique. There's none like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.49,0:53:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得跟他有特别的感情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel a special connection with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.60,0:53:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他从未有败绩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's undefeated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.36,0:53:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是连胜者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the reigning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.37,0:53:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是卫冕方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the defending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.61,0:53:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女士们先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies and gentlemen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.29,0:53:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.18,0:53:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无敌的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... your incredible...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.70,0:53:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绿巨人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hulk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.13,0:53:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.33,0:53:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得离开这个星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to get off this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.02,0:53:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 嘿 嘿 你想去哪啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, hey. Where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.06,0:54:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.16,0:54:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我俩认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.68,0:54:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我战友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a friend from work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.78,0:54:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where have you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.38,0:54:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都以为你死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody thought you were dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.38,0:54:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们上次一别后发生了好多事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But so much has happened since I last saw you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.43,0:54:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我失去了锤子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost my hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.15,0:54:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就昨天 还记忆犹新的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, yesterday, so that's still pretty fresh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.34,0:54:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛基还活着 相信吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loki. Loki's alive. Can you believe it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.93,0:54:28.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.96,0:54:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛基 看这是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loki! Look who it is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.22,0:54:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班纳 真没想到我会这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Banner, I never thought I would say this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.63,0:54:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我见到你可真高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm happy to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.94,0:54:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绿巨人 绿巨人 绿巨人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hulk! Hulk! Hulk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.72,0:54:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.52,0:54:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 班纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Banner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.17,0:54:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是班纳 只有绿巨人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No Banner. Only Hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.85,0:54:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.10,0:54:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我啊 托尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me. It's Thor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.15,0:55:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班纳 我们是朋友啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Banner, we're friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.52,0:55:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这真是疯了 我不想伤你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is crazy. I don't want to hurt you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.36,0:55:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了 这才像话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go. Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.33,0:55:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.14,0:56:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 大块头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, big guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.21,0:56:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太阳快下山了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sun's getting real low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.20,0:56:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 太阳要下山了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. The sun's going down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.66,0:56:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再伤害你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't hurt you anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.67,0:56:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人会伤害你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.46,0:56:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 就是这感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! That's how it feels!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.56,0:56:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是太喜欢这项运动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just a huge fan of the sport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.32,0:56:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 不管了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Screw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.28,0:57:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你还在的 班纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're in there, Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.56,0:57:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会把你逼出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get you out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.82,0:57:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么了 真让我下不来台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with you? You're embarrassing me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.01,0:57:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还跟他们说我们是朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told them we were friends!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.40,0:58:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷哥 雷哥 雷哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thunder! Thunder! Thunder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.10,0:58:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷哥 雷哥 雷哥 雷哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thunder! Thunder! Thunder! Thunder! Thunder! Thunder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.48,0:59:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又一天 又一个道格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another day, another Doug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.37,0:59:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that noise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.53,0:59:47.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,民众并没有乖乖听话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The common folk aren't exactly falling in line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.70,0:59:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有抵抗者想撞倒大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a resistance trying to knock down the front gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.07,0:59:58.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说说你自己吧 斯科尔奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about yourself, Skurge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.09,1:00:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我爸是个石匠 我妈是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, me dad was a stonemason. Me mum was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.95,1:00:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 嗯 打住吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, yeah, I'll just stop you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.82,1:00:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I meant was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.64,1:00:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的野心是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what's your ambition?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.67,1:00:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想要个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want a{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.35,1:00:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,机会证明自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}chance to prove myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.56,1:00:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,认可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recognition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.12,1:00:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我年轻时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was young...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.66,1:00:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每位伟大国王都有个处刑人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every great king had an executioner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.35,1:00:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不仅仅是进行处刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not just to execute people...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.20,1:00:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也执行国王的愿景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but also to execute their vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.27,1:00:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但主要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But mainly to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.98,1:00:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是做处刑的 不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}execute people. Still,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.58,1:00:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这仍是无上光荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was a great honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.02,1:00:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我曾是奥丁的处刑人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was Odin's executioner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.71,1:00:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.89,1:00:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就做我的处刑人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shall be my executioner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.47,1:00:47.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始征程吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's begin our conquest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.01,1:01:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯科尔奇 剑呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skurge, where's the sword?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.92,1:01:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那把剑是打开彩虹桥的钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sword is the key to opening the Bifrost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.00,1:01:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你提到的那些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those people you mentioned,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.40,1:01:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些不肯乖乖就范的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the ones who aren't falling into line...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.12,1:01:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他们都抓起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}round them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.42,1:01:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,借过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.71,1:01:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.64,1:01:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些玩意到处都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These bloody things are everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.85,1:01:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.13,1:02:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在这里是安全的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be safe here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.35,1:03:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没事了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we cool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.02,1:03:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绿巨人洗热浴盆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Hulk in a hot tub.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.98,1:03:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这样多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how long have you been like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.90,1:03:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.45,1:03:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样 大块头 绿色的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like this. Big, and green,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.11,1:03:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呆头呆脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.12,1:04:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绿巨人一直是绿巨人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hulk always Hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.05,1:04:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么到这儿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you get here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.13,1:04:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,靠赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Winning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.53,1:04:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说作弊吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean cheating, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.89,1:04:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你赢的时候 对手也都有这玩意吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were they wearing one of these when you won?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.54,1:04:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么来到这儿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you arrive here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.87,1:04:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昆式战斗机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quinjet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.83,1:04:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 那架昆式战斗机现在在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Now, where is the Quinjet now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.32,1:04:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没穿衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's naked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.44,1:04:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他没穿衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's very naked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.95,1:04:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这下忘不掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in my brain now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.00,1:04:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昆式战斗机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quinjet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.98,1:04:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.00,1:04:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要带咱们离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting us out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.72,1:04:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个糟糕的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a terrible, awful place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.22,1:04:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会喜欢阿斯加德的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna love Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.38,1:04:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很大 还金闪闪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's big. It's golden. Shiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.38,1:05:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绿巨人不走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hulk stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.83,1:05:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不 我的人民需要我回阿斯加德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. My people need me to get back to Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.13,1:05:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得阻止诸神黄昏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must prevent Ragnarok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.90,1:05:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,诸神黄昏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ragnarok?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.32,1:05:10.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我家园的毁灭预言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The prophesied death of my home world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.19,1:05:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界末日 一切终结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The end of days, it's the end of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.61,1:05:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你帮我回阿斯加德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you help me get back to Asgard...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.00,1:05:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以帮你回地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can help you get back to Earth. Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.12,1:05:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地球恨绿巨人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earth hate Hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.41,1:05:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地球爱绿巨人 他们爱死你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earth loves Hulk. They love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.33,1:05:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是复仇者联盟成员 我们的队友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're one of the Avengers. One of the team,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.15,1:05:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one of our friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.46,1:05:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,朋友就该如此 彼此支持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what friends do. They support each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.42,1:05:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是班纳的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Banner's friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.84,1:05:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不是班纳的朋友 我更喜欢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not Banner's friend. I prefer you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.13,1:05:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班纳的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Banner's friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.19,1:05:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都不喜欢班纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even like Banner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.49,1:05:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"我喜欢数字 科学什么的"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I'm into numbers and science and stuff. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.68,1:05:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尔走 绿巨人留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor go. Hulk stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.55,1:05:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.35,1:05:40.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.22,1:05:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,破地方 难看死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid place. It's hideous, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.48,1:05:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又是红 又是白 选个颜色吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The red, the white. Just pick a color.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.40,1:05:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真荒唐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.90,1:05:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,砸扁你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smash you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.27,1:05:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你才没砸扁什么 那场角斗我赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't smash anything. I won that fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.80,1:05:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我砸扁了你 - 好吧 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I smashed you. - Yeah, sure, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.13,1:05:55.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 小手臂 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Baby arms. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.95,1:05:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小个子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.20,1:05:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白痴 你个幼稚鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moron! You big child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.94,1:05:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尔走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor gm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.91,1:06:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.10,1:06:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尔再走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor go again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.12,1:06:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尔在家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.52,1:06:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绿巨人训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hulk trains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.27,1:06:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 祝你开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great. Have fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.13,1:06:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好啊 大块头 - 生气姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, big guy. - Angry girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.12,1:06:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都干什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you been up to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.37,1:06:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,获胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Winning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.16,1:06:45.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海姆达尔 我知道你看得到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heimdall, I know you can see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.66,1:06:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.74,1:06:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我看到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.35,1:07:04.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看得到你 但你在很远的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you, but you're far away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.72,1:07:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.01,1:07:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自己来看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come see for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.08,1:07:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在祖先建造的要塞里庇护大家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm providing refuge in a stronghold built by our ancestors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.30,1:07:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果抵挡不住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if the garrison falls,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.06,1:07:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只能靠彩虹桥逃跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our only escape is Bifrost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.75,1:07:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要疏散整个阿斯加德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're talking about evacuating Asgard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.87,1:07:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果留下我们都活不久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won't last long if we stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.45,1:07:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她汲取阿斯加德的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She draws her power from Asgard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.02,1:07:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每天都更强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and grows stronger every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.20,1:07:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.38,1:07:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海拉很贪婪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hela is ravenous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.95,1:07:36.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我放走了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I let her leave,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.13,1:07:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会吞噬整个九大王国甚至宇宙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she'll consume Nine Realms and all the cosmos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.34,1:07:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.24,1:07:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想办法了 但我都不知道自己在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm working on it. But I don't even know where the hell I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.63,1:07:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你所在的星球周围都是传送门 穿过其中一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're on a planet surrounded by doorways. Go through one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.33,1:07:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哪个 - 大的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Which one? - The big one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.35,1:08:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尔难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.71,1:08:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.39,1:08:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尔难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.05,1:08:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不难过 你个白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sad, you idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.18,1:08:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我在生气 - 噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm pissed off! - Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.07,1:08:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愤怒 我失去了父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angry. I lost my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.88,1:08:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我失去了锤子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost my hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.20,1:08:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你都没认真听 - 唧唧歪歪 像个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're not even listening. - Whining and crying. Cry like baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.79,1:08:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别踢东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't kick stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.53,1:08:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真不够朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're being a really bad friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.78,1:08:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你才不够朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bad friend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.12,1:08:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你知道我们怎么喊你吗 - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know what we call you? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.54,1:08:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们喊你蠢复仇者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We call you the stupid Avenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.45,1:08:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是小复仇者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're tiny Avenger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.24,1:08:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, are you crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.40,1:08:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.32,1:08:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.55,1:08:57.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地球是恨你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earth does hate you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.81,1:09:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.26,1:09:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.68,1:09:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了那些话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.62,1:09:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是蠢复仇者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not the stupid Avenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.82,1:09:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人喊你蠢复仇者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody calls you the stupid Avenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.89,1:09:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.41,1:09:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能随便冲人仍盾牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just can't go around throwing shields at people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.33,1:09:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,差点杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could have killed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.05,1:09:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.17,1:09:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我总是好生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just get so angry all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.85,1:09:38.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绿巨人总是很生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hulk always, always angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.18,1:09:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 我们是一样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. We're the same, you and I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.10,1:09:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就是俩鲁莽的傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just a couple of hot-headed fools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.74,1:09:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是啊 一样 绿巨人是火 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, same. Hulk like fire, - Mum{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.56,1:09:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尔是水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor like water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.60,1:09:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're kind of both like fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.59,1:09:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但绿巨人是真火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Hulk like real fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.52,1:09:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绿巨人是烈火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hulk like raging fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.11,1:09:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,托尔是阴燃火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor like smoldering fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.96,1:10:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绿巨人 我需要你帮我个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hulk, I need you to do something for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.20,1:10:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生气姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Angry girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.60,1:10:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on? What are you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.35,1:10:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就蠢到看不出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so thick-headed that you can't tell...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.32,1:10:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人家远远躲到了宇宙尽头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when someone's hiding all the way across{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.69,1:10:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是不想被打扰吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the universe and wants to be left alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.40,1:10:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们得谈谈 - 不 你想跟我谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We need to talk. - No, you wanna talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.47,1:10:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要她留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need her to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.85,1:10:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.57,1:10:41.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挡住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Block.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.44,1:10:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.07,1:10:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拜托 - 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please. - Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.98,1:10:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.04,1:10:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.20,1:10:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll listen to you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.62,1:10:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喝光这个我就走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}till this is empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.46,1:11:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德有危险 人民在牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asgard is in danger and people are dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.73,1:11:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得回去 我需要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get back there. I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.40,1:11:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喝完了 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finished. Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.20,1:11:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥丁死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Odin is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.71,1:11:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡女神海拉 入侵了阿斯加德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hela, the Goddess of Death, has invaded Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.75,1:11:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果海拉回来了 那阿斯加德无望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Hela's back, then Asgard's already lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.37,1:11:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要阻止她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to stop her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.86,1:11:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 一个人吗 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Alone? - Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.95,1:11:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在组建一支队伍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm putting together a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.65,1:11:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我 你还有大块头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me, you, and the big guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.50,1:11:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不组队 绿巨人单干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No team. Only Hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.00,1:11:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me and you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.99,1:11:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看是只有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's only you.{\r}
