Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.54,1:11:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德的精英武士 发誓保护王权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elite warriors of Asgard sworn to defend the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.73,1:11:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不要再次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not getting dragged into{\r}
