Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.71,1:11:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这话什么意思 - 你姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that supposed to mean? - Your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.54,1:11:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的力量来自阿斯加德 你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her power comes from Asgard, same as yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.63,1:11:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当奥丁无法控制她的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When it grew beyond Odin's control{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.85,1:11:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她就屠杀了王宫里的每个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she massacred everyone in the palace...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.53,1:11:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,企图夺取王位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tried to seize the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.18,1:11:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她企图逃离驱逐时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When she tried to escape her banishment...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.90,1:11:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他派女武神去抵抗她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he sent the Valkyrie in to fight her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.56,1:11:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能生还只是因为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only survived because...{\r}
