Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.64,1:20:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 要下山了 - 哦 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's getting real low. - Oh, shoot.{\r}
