Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.77,1:20:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 - 不是你家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Not your home,{\r}
