Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.57,1:25:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.93,1:25:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是著名的女武神之剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the famed sword of the Valkyrie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.82,1:25:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨卡和阿斯加德之间离得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sakaar and Asgard are about as far apart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.14,1:25:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能更远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as any two known systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.45,1:25:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最好的办法 是走城外的一个虫洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our best bet is a wormhole just outside of city limits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.11,1:25:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在山达尔补充燃料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Refuel on Xandar, and we can be back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.67,1:25:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,18个月后就能回到阿斯加德了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in Asgard in 18 months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.04,1:25:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我们要走大的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope. We are going through the big one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.46,1:25:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼屁眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Devil's Anus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.91,1:25:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,屁眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.01,1:25:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 谁的屁眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, wait. Whose anus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.17,1:25:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,声明一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the record, I didn't know it was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.32,1:25:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我选的时候不知道它叫这么个名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}called that when I picked it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.49,1:25:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来像是在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That looks like a collapsing neutron star...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.40,1:25:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱因斯坦罗森桥内坍缩的中子星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}inside of an Einstein-Rosen Bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.57,1:25:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要另找艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need another ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.08,1:25:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它会把我的船撕成碎片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would tear mine to pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.59,1:25:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说得对 我们需要一艘能禁得住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's right. We need one that can withstand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.26,1:25:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奇点短程线拉力的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the geodetic strain from the singularity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.06,1:25:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还得有脱机动力转向系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And has an offline power steering system...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.88,1:26:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有机载电脑也能运行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that could also function without the on-board computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.41,1:26:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还得有杯托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we need one with cup holders,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.89,1:26:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们要死了 喝酒吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because we're gonna die. So, drinks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.99,1:26:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认识你吗 我好像认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I know you? I feel like I know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.25,1:26:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也觉得我认识你 好奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like I know you, too. It's weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.87,1:26:08.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.89,1:26:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穿过不稳定的宇宙传送门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uncharted metagalactic travel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.38,1:26:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进行未知总星系旅行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}through a volatile cosmic gateway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.00,1:26:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才叫冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talk about an adventure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.18,1:26:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们需要一艘飞船 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We need a ship. - Need a ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.44,1:26:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有那么一两艘飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are one or two ships.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.84,1:26:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 绝对是最顶尖的 - 你们不非得听我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Absolute top of the line models... - I don't mean to impose...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.83,1:26:24.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但宗师有很多飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the Grandmaster has a great many ships.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.78,1:26:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可能还偷到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may even have stolen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.29,1:26:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他安全系统的密码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the access codes to his security system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.41,1:26:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还突然难以抑制地想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And suddenly you're overcome with an urge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.16,1:26:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 行正义之举吗 - 天啊 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- to do the right thing. - Heavens, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.95,1:26:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宗师对我的好感已消磨殆尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've run out of favor with the Grandmaster...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.76,1:26:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我用飞船和密码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and in exchange for codes and access to a ship...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.78,1:26:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,换安全穿过屁眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm asking for safe passage through the Anus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.39,1:26:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说 你能让我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're telling us that you can get usaccess{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.34,1:26:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进入机库 而不触发警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into the garage without setting off any alarms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.28,1:26:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 哥哥 我可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, brother. I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.67,1:26:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我先 提醒你们一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, can I just... A quick FYI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.87,1:26:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我几分钟前跟他说话的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just talking to him just a couple minutes ago...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.98,1:26:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很想杀了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he was totally ready to kill any of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.38,1:26:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他确实想杀我来着 - 是啊 我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He did try to kill me. - Yes, me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.95,1:26:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好多次呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On many, many occasions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.36,1:26:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们小时候 有一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was one time when we were children...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.31,1:27:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他变成了一条蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he transformed himself into a snake,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.02,1:27:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他知道我喜欢蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he knows that I love snakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.40,1:27:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我捡起蛇 好好欣赏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I went to pick up the snake to admire it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.19,1:27:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果他变了回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he transformed back into himself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.79,1:27:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大喊 "嘿 是我" 然后捅了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he was like, "Yeah, it's me!" And he stabbed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.24,1:27:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们当时才八岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were eight at the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.44,1:27:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要偷飞船的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we're boosting a ship...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.69,1:27:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得把王宫的守卫引开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're gonna need to draw some guards away from the palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.72,1:27:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放出野兽吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not set the beast loose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.31,1:27:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh... Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.48,1:27:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们有野兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys have a beast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.65,1:27:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 没什么野兽 他在胡说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, there's no beast. He's just being stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.16,1:27:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要挑起革命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to start a revolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.77,1:27:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 革命 - 我过会儿再解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Revolution? - I'll explain later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.69,1:27:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他是谁来着 - 过会儿再解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's this guy again? - I'll explain later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.09,1:27:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你拉出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that some sort of protoplasm,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.41,1:27:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是原生质吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all the stuff that's coming out of you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.01,1:27:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是卵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or are they eggs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.32,1:27:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来像卵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.04,1:27:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我找寇格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking for Korg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.49,1:27:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's asking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.93,1:27:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're asking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.06,1:27:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有别人吗 还是只有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is anyone else asking, or is it just you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.73,1:27:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷王向你问好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lord of Thunder sends his best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.15,1:27:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,革命开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The revolution has begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.56,1:27:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,革命 怎么会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Revolution? How did this happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.77,1:28:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.29,1:28:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但角斗场的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the arena's mainframe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.91,1:28:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,服从圆盘主机被关掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the Obedience Disks have been deactivated...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.58,1:28:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 奴隶都武装起来了 - 哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and the slaves have armed themselves. - Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.14,1:28:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢那个词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I don't like that word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.11,1:28:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪个 主机吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which? Mainframe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.29,1:28:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 我怎么会不喜欢"主机"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Why would I not like "mainframe"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.74,1:28:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,S开头的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, the "S" word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.99,1:28:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 在职囚犯们都武装起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, the prisoners with jobs have armed themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.04,1:28:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that's better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.63,1:28:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我们应该谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, so, listen. We should talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.94,1:28:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I disagree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.34,1:28:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们家从来就不擅长开诚布公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open communication was never our family's forte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.43,1:28:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可不是呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.84,1:28:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们上次谈过后发现的真相很是了不得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been quite the revelation since we last spoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.96,1:28:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.44,1:28:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.62,1:28:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥丁让我们聚在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Odin brought us together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.10,1:28:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的死让我们分裂 还挺诗意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's almost poetic that his death should split us apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.00,1:29:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在与陌生人无异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We might as well be strangers now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.33,1:29:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两位王子 各自漂泊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two sons of the crown, set adrift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.42,1:29:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是不想谈吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought you didn't wanna talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.84,1:29:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问题是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.98,1:29:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可能留在萨卡更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm probably better off staying here on Sakaar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.85,1:29:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly what I was thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.39,1:29:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚是在同意我说的话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you just agree with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.86,1:29:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方太适合你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, this place is perfect for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.52,1:29:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,野蛮 混乱 无法无天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's savage, chaotic, lawless...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.49,1:29:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弟弟 你会在这儿如鱼得水的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brother, you're gonna do great here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.27,1:29:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就真这么瞧不起我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you truly think so little of me'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.19,1:29:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛基 我曾非常看重你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loki, I thought the world of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.04,1:29:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我们能永远并肩战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we were gonna fight side by side forever. But{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.03,1:29:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但最终 你是你 我是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the end of the day, you're you and I'm me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.29,1:29:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也说不好 或许你还有一丝良心 但\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, maybe there's still good in you. But{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.91,1:29:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's be honest,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.94,1:29:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们早已分道扬镳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our paths diverged a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.08,1:29:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.45,1:29:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们还是再也不要见面了比较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's probably for the best that we never see each other again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.66,1:29:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你一直想要的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what you always wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.36,1:30:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来演"喊救命"吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, let's do "Get Help. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.22,1:30:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么 - "喊救命"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - "Get Help. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.67,1:30:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 我非常讨厌 - 来嘛 你最喜欢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. I hate it. - Come on, you love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.65,1:30:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这招多棒啊 每次都好使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's great. It works every time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.68,1:30:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 太丢人了 - 你有更好的计划吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's humiliating. - Do you have a better plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.25,1:30:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没有 - 那就这么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - We're doing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.88,1:30:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不要演"喊救命"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not doing "Get Help. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.02,1:30:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命 求你们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get help! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.51,1:30:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我弟弟快死了 救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brother, he's dying. Get help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.37,1:30:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮他吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.43,1:30:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 完美 - 经典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's good. - Classic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.62,1:30:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是讨厌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Sun hate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.23,1:30:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 太丢人了 - 我又不丢人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's humiliating. - Not for me, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.83,1:30:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 她让我们上哪艘船来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, which one's the ship she told us to get?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.37,1:30:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,司令号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Commodore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.88,1:30:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.58,1:30:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我觉得应该也没什么用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though I feel it won't make much of a difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.33,1:30:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 洛基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Loki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.23,1:30:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我背叛过你很多次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I've betrayed you many times... before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.94,1:30:42.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这次真不是针对你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this time it's truly nothing personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.94,1:30:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓到你的赏金会让我过得很阔绰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The reward for your capture will set me up nicely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.04,1:30:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你果然从不是个重感情的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never one for sentiment, were you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.67,1:30:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无情会过得更轻松些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easier to let it burn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.61,1:30:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.90,1:31:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来好痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that looks painful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.28,1:31:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的弟弟 你越来越好猜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, dear brother, you're becoming predictable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.40,1:31:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我信任你 你背叛我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust you, you betray me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.40,1:31:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一遍又一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Round and round in circles we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.67,1:31:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛基 人生 是要成长的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, Loki, life is about, it's about growth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.94,1:31:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是要改变的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.03,1:31:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你好像只想保持原样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you seem to just wanna stay the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.88,1:31:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想说的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess what I'm trying to say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.54,1:31:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你永远都只是恶作剧之神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that you'll always be the God of Mischief...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.96,1:31:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你本可不止如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you could be more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.72,1:31:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就把这个留给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll just put this over here for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.12,1:31:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们都还有地方要去 所以祝你好运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, all got places to be, so good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.19,1:31:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 你能搞定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I can figure this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.23,1:31:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过是又一艘宇宙飞船罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just another spaceship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.75,1:31:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,忠诚的萨卡人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loyal Sakaarians...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.55,1:31:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷王偷了我的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord of Thunder has stolen my ship{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.52,1:31:58.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和我最爱的冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my favorite champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.44,1:32:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨卡人 升空 把他打下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sakaarians, take to the skies. Bring him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.95,1:32:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要让他离开这个星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not let him leave this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.74,1:32:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 打得不错 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good shot! - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.04,1:32:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.16,1:32:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.76,1:32:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你比看起来要坚强一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope that you're tougher than you look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.79,1:32:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.02,1:32:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不该反击什么的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shouldn't we be shooting back or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.34,1:32:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是应该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.61,1:32:50.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这船上的武器在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are the guns on this ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.39,1:32:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There aren't any.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.89,1:32:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是艘消遣船 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a leisure vessel. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.72,1:32:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宗师用它来享乐的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grandmaster uses it for his good times,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.76,1:32:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,群交派对之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}orgies and stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.06,1:32:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她刚刚是说宗师用这船办群交派对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did she just say the Grandmaster uses it for orgies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.71,1:33:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.90,1:33:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么都别碰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.62,1:33:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.79,1:33:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.24,1:33:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get inside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.53,1:33:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.16,1:33:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该去帮帮她 你过来开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should probably go and help. Here, take the wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.12,1:33:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我不会开这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I don't know how to fly one of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.69,1:33:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个科学家 用你的博士学位去搞明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a scientist. Use one of your PhDs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.63,1:33:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些学位都不是外星飞船驾驶啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of them are for flying alien spaceships!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.50,1:34:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.66,1:34:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这上面肯定有枪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's gotta be a gun on this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.75,1:34:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那看起来好像是枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That looks like a gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.09,1:34:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我生日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my birthday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.54,1:34:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我生日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my birthday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.43,1:34:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我生日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my birthday{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.64,1:34:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.16,1:35:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们 我们马上就要进入恶魔屁眼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, we're coming up on the Devil's Anus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.37,1:35:19.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.53,1:35:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们逃离的途径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our ticket out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.01,1:35:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.37,1:35:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 - 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Hey, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.90,1:35:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄 我们要跳上那艘超大飞船离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're about to jump on that ginormous spaceship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.17,1:35:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要一起来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.28,1:35:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do seem like{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.98,1:35:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确实急需一位领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're in desperate need of leadership.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.81,1:35:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.15,1:35:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.78,1:35:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.15,1:36:10.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asgardians...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.26,1:36:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有不知好歹的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some misguided soul...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.41,1:36:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,偷走了彩虹桥之剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has stolen the Bifrost sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.85,1:36:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我们它在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell us where it is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.26,1:36:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则后果自负\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or there will be consequences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.80,1:36:26.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,严重的后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.01,1:36:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人说吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.19,1:36:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.15,1:36:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.76,1:36:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.64,1:37:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,动手啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.88,1:37:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,处刑人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Executioner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.73,1:37:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.17,1:37:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.40,1:37:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道剑在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know where the sword is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.53,1:38:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没想到我还能再回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought I'd be back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.29,1:38:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为会更美一些呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it'd be a lot nicer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.19,1:38:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,倒不是说它不美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, not that it's not nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.02,1:38:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是着火了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just, it's on fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.59,1:38:25.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看 山上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, up here in the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.01,1:38:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有热信号 那里聚集了很多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heat signatures. People clustered together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.42,1:38:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她要去找他们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's coming for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.58,1:38:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 把我丢在王宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, drop me off at the palace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.78,1:38:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我去引开她 - 你想害死自己吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and I'll draw her away. - And get yourself killed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.03,1:38:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,困在那里的人才是最重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people trapped down there are all that matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.78,1:38:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去应付海拉时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While I'm dealing with Hela, I need you two{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.37,1:38:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们得疏散阿斯加德的人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to help get everyone off Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.08,1:38:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要怎么做啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell are we supposed to do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.04,1:38:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在地面上有人接应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a man on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.75,1:38:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.97,1:38:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.06,1:39:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这下飞船有火力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now the ship has a gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.76,1:39:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,交给我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take it from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.85,1:39:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在武器库发现了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found this in the armory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.25,1:39:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.86,1:39:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Majesty...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.19,1:39:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.08,1:39:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你懂我意思的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.88,1:40:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别停步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must keep moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.39,1:40:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去彩虹桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to the Bifrost!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.72,1:41:13.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.15,1:41:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.02,1:41:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你对这里的改造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love what you've done with the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.03,1:41:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重装修了啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Redecorating, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.66,1:41:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们父亲解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems our father's solution{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.87,1:41:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有问题的思路都是掩盖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to every problem was to cover it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.85,1:41:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或驱逐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or to cast it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.26,1:41:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他对你说你有资格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told you you were worthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.60,1:41:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他也对我说过这话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said the same thing to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.86,1:41:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.92,1:41:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不了解他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never knew him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.30,1:41:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没见过他最辉煌的时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not at his best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.74,1:41:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥丁和我曾让整个文明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Odin and I drowned entire civilizations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.41,1:41:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,淹死在血泪之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in blood and tears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.26,1:41:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为这些金子是哪来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you think all this gold came from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.43,1:41:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.60,1:41:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一天他突然决定做个仁慈的君王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one day he decided to become a benevolent king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.31,1:41:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,制造和平 保护生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To foster peace, to protect life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.02,1:42:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生下你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to have you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.22,1:42:03.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能理解你的愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand why you're angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.22,1:42:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你毕竟是我姐姐 严格讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are my sister, and technically{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.15,1:42:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有权继承王位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have a claim to the throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.74,1:42:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 我也愿意别人来统治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And believe me, I would love for someone else to rule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.82,1:42:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那不能是你 你真是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it can't be you. You're just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.21,1:42:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坏透了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.29,1:42:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.30,1:42:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你坐在我的位置上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in my seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.11,1:42:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,父亲曾对我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Father once told me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.42,1:42:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一位明君从不挑起战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that a wise king never seeks out war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.11,1:42:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但必须时刻做好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But must always be ready for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.72,1:43:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.39,1:43:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.85,1:43:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说 我以为你有更大本事呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be honest, I expected more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.39,1:43:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海姆达尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heimdall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.87,1:43:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sword!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.09,1:44:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的不同之处在于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the difference between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.86,1:44:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是奥丁的长女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Odin's firstborn...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.45,1:44:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,合法继承人 阿斯加德的拯救者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the rightful heir, the savior of Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.30,1:44:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.05,1:44:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如此简单 瞎子都看得清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So simple, even a blind man could see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.74,1:44:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这下你让我想起了爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you remind me of Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.20,1:44:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那只臭狗打不死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stupid dog won't die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.89,1:45:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事了 交给我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's gonna be all right now. I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.70,1:45:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted to know who I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.09,1:45:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.96,1:45:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会看到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll see!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.01,1:46:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧 谁都别想跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see? No one's going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.43,1:46:01.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会拿到那把剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get that sword...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.68,1:46:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪怕我为此要杀光他们每个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even if I have to kill every single one of them to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.47,1:46:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.82,1:46:35.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是寇格 这是米克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Korg. This is Miek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.32,1:46:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要跳上那艘飞船离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna jump on that spaceshipand get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.30,1:46:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要一起来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.31,1:46:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的拯救者到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your savior is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.62,1:46:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想我了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you miss me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.42,1:47:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家快上船吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone, on that ship now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.55,1:47:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回家 我看到你来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome home. I saw you coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.83,1:47:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.78,1:47:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然是英勇之举 但你们毫无胜算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a valiant effort, but you never stood a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.85,1:47:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.53,1:47:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是女王 或怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a queen or a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.65,1:47:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是死亡女神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the Goddess of Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.26,1:47:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么的神来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you the god of, again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.03,1:47:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就算是你有两只眼睛时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even when you had two eyes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.76,1:47:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也只能看清一半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd see only half the picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.01,1:48:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她太强大了 没有锤子 我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's too strong. Without my hammer, I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.08,1:48:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是托尔 锤子之神吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you Thor, the God of Hammers? Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.78,1:48:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,锤子是用来帮你控制力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That hammer was to help you control your power,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.32,1:48:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,集中力量的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to focus it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.35,1:48:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是你力量的源泉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was never your source of strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.71,1:48:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太迟了 她已经夺下了阿斯加德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late. She's already taken Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.12,1:48:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德不是一个地方 从来不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asgard is not a place. Never was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.09,1:48:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里就可以是阿斯加德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could be Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.66,1:48:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德是我们人民的所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asgard is where our people stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.57,1:48:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.52,1:48:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些人民需要你的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right now, those people need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.08,1:48:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不像你那么强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not as strong as you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.95,1:48:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.38,1:48:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你比我更强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.73,1:49:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.16,1:49:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么的神来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you the god of again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.08,1:51:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你来迟了 - 你缺了只眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're late. - You're missing an eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.40,1:51:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还没打完呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.10,1:51:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们该解散报仇者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we should disband the Revengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.43,1:51:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用闪电打她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit her with a lightning blast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.79,1:51:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚用史上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just hit her with the biggest lightning blast{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.54,1:51:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最大的闪电打她了 毫无作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the history of lightning. It did nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.98,1:51:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得抵住她 直到大家都上了船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just need to hold her off until everyone's on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.14,1:51:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那也不是个完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't end there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.95,1:51:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海拉在阿斯加德待得越久 她就越强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The longer Hela's on Asgard, the more powerful she grows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.55,1:51:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会找到我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll hunt us down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.49,1:51:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得在此时此地阻止她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to stop her here and now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.28,1:51:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.18,1:51:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不要再演"喊救命"了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not doing "Get Help. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.75,1:52:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德不是一个地方 是人民所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asgard's not a place, it's a people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.29,1:52:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loki...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.32,1:52:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们根本不是要阻止诸神黄昏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this was never about stopping Ragnarok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.61,1:52:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要引发诸神黄昏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was about causing Ragnarok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.73,1:52:22.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏尔特尔的王冠 在地堡里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surtur's crown, the vault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.84,1:52:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只能如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.00,1:52:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真大胆 哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bold move, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.66,1:52:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都不敢想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.46,1:52:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.66,1:52:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你先请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.15,1:53:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这真是疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.09,1:53:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Go, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.87,1:54:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了阿斯加德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.50,1:54:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hela!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.46,1:55:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永恒烈火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the Eternal Flame,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.06,1:55:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将让你重生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are reborn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.91,1:55:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海拉 够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hela, enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.15,1:55:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要阿斯加德 它是你的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want Asgard, it's yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.08,1:55:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你在玩什么把戏 不会成功的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever game you're playing, it won't work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.73,1:55:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你休想打败我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't defeat me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.13,1:55:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.26,1:55:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.48,1:55:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.73,1:55:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我脚下震颤吧 阿斯加德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tremble before me, Asgard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.27,1:55:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的末日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am your reckoning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.81,1:56:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人民安全了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people are safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.00,1:56:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那才是最重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all that matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.56,1:56:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们实现了预言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're fulfilling the prophecy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.55,1:56:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我恨这则预言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate this prophecy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.93,1:56:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是 但我们没别的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do I, but we have no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.05,1:56:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,苏尔特尔毁掉阿斯加德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surtur destroys Asgard...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.70,1:56:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才能毁掉海拉 我们的人民才能生还\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he destroys Hela, so that our people may live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.34,1:56:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们得让他做完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we need to let him finish the job,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.19,1:56:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}otherwise...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.25,1:56:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.39,1:56:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绿巨人 停下 你个白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hulk, stop, you moron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.42,1:56:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绿巨人 停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hulk, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.69,1:56:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这一次 别砸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just for once in your life, don't smash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.68,1:56:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big monster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.89,1:56:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.91,1:56:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.13,1:57:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是阿斯加德的末日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Asgard's doom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.05,1:57:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毁得还不算太严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The damage is not too bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.43,1:57:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要地基还撑得住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as the foundations are still strong...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.26,1:57:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还能重建\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can rebuild this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.43,1:57:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它可以成为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will become a haven...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.41,1:57:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全宇宙人民和外星人的避难所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for all peoples and aliens of the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.18,1:58:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这下地基是没了 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now those foundations are gone. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.88,1:58:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做了什么啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have I done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.05,1:58:20.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你让我们免遭灭绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved us from extinction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.63,1:58:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德不是一个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asgard is not a place...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.91,1:58:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是人民的所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's a people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.72,1:58:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挺适合你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It suits you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.97,1:59:02.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你也没那么坏 弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you're not so bad after all, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.04,1:59:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.36,1:59:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.28,1:59:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真在这里 我或许还会抱抱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you were here, I might even give you a hug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.91,1:59:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.57,1:59:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的王位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your throne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.96,1:59:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.21,1:59:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿斯加德国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}King of Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.57,2:00:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.87,2:00:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.83,2:00:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么提议吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any Suggestions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.69,2:00:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米克 你是哪来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miek, where are you from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.96,2:00:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米克死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Miek's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.90,2:00:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我刚刚在桥上不小心踩到了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, no, I accidentally stomped on him on the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.05,2:00:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好愧疚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've just felt so guilty,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.49,2:00:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我抱了他一天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been carrying him around all day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.43,2:00:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米克 你还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miek, you're alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.02,2:00:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还活着 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's alive, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.16,2:00:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚问什么来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was your question again, bro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.09,2:00:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去地球吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earth it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.10,2:02:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得回地球是个好主意吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really think it's a good idea to go back to Earth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.00,2:02:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.06,2:03:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地球人民喜欢我 我很受欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people of Earth love me. I'm very popular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.87,2:03:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我换个说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me rephrase that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.87,2:03:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得带我回地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you really think it's a good idea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.77,2:03:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是个好主意吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to bring me back to Earth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.76,2:03:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说 或许不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably not, to be honest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.82,2:03:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't worry, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.57,2:03:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得一切都会没问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like everything's gonna work out fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.69,2:09:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:52.23,2:09:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想说 我为你们所有人骄傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just gotta say, I'm proud of you all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.58,2:09:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这场革命非常成功 大家好棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This revolution has been a huge success. Yay, us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:00.07,2:10:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鼓励鼓励自己 干得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pat on the back. Pat on the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:02.70,2:10:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来嘛 不吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. No?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.35,2:10:07.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是 因为我是其中重要的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me too. 'Cause I've been a big part of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:07.55,2:10:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人去推翻 哪里来的革命呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't have a revolution without somebody to overthrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:10.33,2:10:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:12.58,2:10:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们平手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, uh, it's a tie.{\r}
